WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Automation lanes put a parameter's curve right under its track, as in Live.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Turn them on in the Playlist's menu, Automation lanes, or in the LYNX extras.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.600
Point at a track's name and click plus A: pick what to automate, here the volume.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.400
Click in the lane to add points. Drag a point to move it, right-click to delete it.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Alt and drag a line to bend it. The lane folds with the track's arrow.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:38.200
Play: the chords swell and fade with the curve.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.400
FL's automation clips still work, and can sit as lanes under their tracks too.
